                <mxCell id="N2" value="⚠ Steps 5–7: No API or real-time availability — representatives must phone the shop. Centers often don&#39;t answer; historically &quot;one-and-done&quot;, so follow-ups get missed." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe0e0;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#7a2e2e;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;size=16;" parent="1" vertex="1">
