                <mxCell id="NX" value="✗ The retry is manual and not enforced. In practice it is often never made), so the request silently stalls and is dropped —, and the customer is never told.&amp;nbsp;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffd6d6;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#7a2e2e;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;size=16;" parent="1" vertex="1">
