                <mxCell id="2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; &quot;&gt;Questions: (?)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; &quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;1. is the quote accepted immeditaly, or should it be negotiated&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;2. is the order a paper created by a human, could this be automated?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;3. how does the client that need state paper work send the documents?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; &quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
